\par\par \b \uc2 Sing dollar off lows but cenbank presence suspected  \b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Januar 2006\par 05:04\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE, Jan 6 (Reuters) - The Singapore dollar recovered from lows hit in early trades on Friday despite suspicion in the market that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was still checking levels.  \par \par \uc2  Traders suspected that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MAS) had caused the Sing dollar <SGD=> to retreat from an overnight high of 1.6450 per U.S. dollar.  \par \par \uc2  At 0350 GMT, the Singapore dollar was quoted at 1.6475/80, off a low of 1.6495.  \par \par \uc2  "I heard they are checking levels, and that they were buying (U.S. dollars) some two hours ago," a Singapore dollar trader said.  \par \par \uc2  But another trader said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was no longer selling the Sing dollar to cap the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2  "They (MAS) possibly bought U.S. dollars overnight. But their agents have been sellers all morning. Even now they are selling at 1.6482," said the trader.  \par \par \uc2  Talk of MAS \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  gained credence after traders reported that other central banks, such as South Korea's and Taiwan's, had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to rein in their rallying \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday.  \par \par \uc2  The won <KRW=> <KRW=KFTC> was forced off Thursday's eight-year high.  \par \par \uc2  Traders in \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  have been expecting the MAS to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hit a seven-month high this week and moved to near the top end of the undisclosed trade-weighed band within which the authorities manage it.     \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-SINGAPORE-DOLLAR|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|SI|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060106e2160005u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
