 \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 -By Saeed Azhar and Ron Harui, Dow Jones Newswires;  \par \par \uc2 65-6415-4157; saeed.azhar@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Stephen Wright [ 16-12-05 0203GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020051216e1cg0001e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
