\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Singapore \highlight\uc2  dollar above low on  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  fears  \b0\par\par\uc2 301 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 November 2005\par 03:18\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SINGAPORE\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Nov 14 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar on Monday pulled away from 4-month lows hit on Friday, supported by wariness that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to bolster the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said.  \par \par \uc2  At 0200 GMT, the Singapore dollar <SGD=> was trading at about 1.7010 per U.S. dollar, steady from late Asian levels on Friday but above a 4-month low at about 1.7045 hit that session.  \par \par \uc2  Broad-based U.S. dollar strength and a break of key chart support levels have undermined Singapore's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2  Dealers said talk that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to bolster the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was providing support, although no actual \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had so far been seen.  \par \par \uc2  "There is talk that the MAS could check \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates at about 1.7025, so the market is wary about \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said a trader in \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar is managed within a secret trade-weighted \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  band.  \par \par \uc2  An analyst estimated the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was trading about 0.5 percent weaker than the mid-point of a 1.5 percent-wide trading band.  \par \par \uc2  Despite support for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said further near-term weakness was likely.  \par \par \uc2  "The Singapore dollar is taking its direction from the U.S. dollar," said Thio Chin Loo, senior \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at BNP Paribas in Singapore.  \par \par \uc2  "Unless there is a reversal in the dollar's trend against the euro and the yen, the bias will be towards more dollar strength against the Singapore dollar."  \par \par \uc2  The Singapore dollar has been weakening against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  since about mid-August, shedding almost 3.5 percent.     \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2 -SINGAPORE|LANGEN|Table|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|SI|Z|IF|PHD|J|SNS|SNI|RNP|DNP|PTD  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020051114e1be0004e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
